              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kĩla mũthenya mekalaa ĩkalũnĩ na ngoo ĩmwe, na makĩtila kĩmũtũ nyũmbanĩ kwoo, nĩmaĩsaa lĩu woo na mũyo na ngoo ĩmwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
